<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/resources/">Free tools and resources</a> / Competitor analysis</nav>
    <h1>See how you stack up against the competitors homeowners compare you to.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tell us up to three competitors — or ask us to find them — and we'll manually compare websites, branding and visible online presence. No fabricated traffic, revenue or ranking numbers; only what's actually publicly visible.</p>
