<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="covers-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="covers-h">What the comparison covers</h2>
      <p class="lede">Everything here comes from something publicly visible right now — never an estimate of a competitor's traffic, revenue or rankings, since nobody outside their own analytics can see those honestly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rows">
      <div class="row"><h3>Website quality</h3><p>Design, clarity of services and how current each site looks.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Mobile experience</h3><p>How each site actually behaves on a phone.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Business positioning</h3><p>What each business leads with: price, speed, trust or specialty.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Visible calls to action</h3><p>What each site asks a visitor to do, and how often.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Public review information</h3><p>Review count and rating as currently shown on Google — a snapshot, not a tracked trend.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Local business information</h3><p>Service area and category as each business publicly states it.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Directory presence</h3><p>Only where we actually checked — never guessed.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><h3>Branding quality</h3><p>Logo, colour consistency and overall visual polish, compared side by side.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="form-head-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="form-head-h">Know your competitors, or want us to find them?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Either works. Tell us up to three business names if you already know who you're compared to most often, or leave it blank and ask us to identify them from a plain local search.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ink" id="competitor-form">
  <div class="wrap lead">
    <div class="lead-copy">
      <h2>Request my free comparison</h2>
      <p class="lede">Manually reviewed, delivered by email.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Only publicly visible information, never fabricated numbers</li>
        <li>You name competitors, or we identify them for you</li>
        <li>No payment details, no obligation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- if site.formspreeId %}
    <form class="form" data-lead-form="competitor_analysis" name="competitor-analysis" method="POST" action="https://formspree.io/f/{{ site.formspreeId }}">
      <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/thank-you/resources/">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New lead: competitor analysis">
      <input type="hidden" name="offer" value="competitor-analysis">
      {%- include "partials/lead-attribution-fields.njk" %}
      <p class="fine full">Fields marked <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span> are required.</p>
      <p class="hidden"><label>Leave this empty <input name="_gotcha"></label></p>
    {%- else %}
    <form class="form" data-lead-form="competitor_analysis" name="competitor-analysis" method="POST" action="/thank-you/resources/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="competitor-analysis">
      <input type="hidden" name="offer" value="competitor-analysis">
      {%- include "partials/lead-attribution-fields.njk" %}
      <p class="fine full">Fields marked <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span> are required.</p>
      <p class="hidden"><label>Leave this empty <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
    {%- endif %}
      <div><label for="ca-business">Your business name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ca-business" name="business" autocomplete="organization" required aria-required="true"></div>
      <div><label for="ca-trade">Industry <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ca-trade" name="trade" placeholder="e.g. roofing, HVAC, renovations" required aria-required="true"></div>
      <div><label for="ca-city">City or service area <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ca-city" name="city" placeholder="e.g. Whitby" required aria-required="true"></div>
      <div><label for="ca-site">Your website URL <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="ca-site" name="website" inputmode="url" placeholder="yourbusiness.ca"></div>
      <div class="full"><label for="ca-competitors">Up to three competitors <span>(optional — leave blank and we'll identify them)</span></label><textarea id="ca-competitors" name="competitors" placeholder="Competitor names or website URLs, one per line"></textarea></div>
      <div><label for="ca-email">Email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ca-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required aria-required="true"></div>
      <div><label for="ca-phone">Phone <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="ca-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel"></div>
      <div class="full"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Request my free comparison</button></div>
      <p class="fine full">We use your details only to build your comparison and follow up about it. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-h">Questions before you request yours</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>Will you show me their traffic, revenue or rankings?</summary><div><p>No. Those aren't honestly observable from outside a business's own analytics, so we don't estimate or guess at them. We compare what's actually publicly visible: websites, branding, visible reviews and listed services.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What if I don't know who my real competitors are?</summary><div><p>Leave the competitor field blank and tell us that — we'll identify a few from a plain local search for your trade and city.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>What do I get?</summary><div><p>A written, side-by-side comparison with recommended improvements, delivered by email.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
